      *    Move  &kunde-id               To    R1781910-In-Kunde-ID     00200001
      *                                                                 00210001
      *    Call  'F1781910'              Using R1781910-Kunde-ID        00220001
      *                                        R7919999-Error           00230001
      *    End-Call                                                     00240001
      *    If  Not R7919999-Retur-OK                                    00250001
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        00260001
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00270001
      *    End-If                                                       00280001
      *                                                                 00290001
      *  enten:                                                         00300001
      *    Move  R1781910-Ut-Kunde-ID    To    &...                     00310001
      *  eller:                                                         00320001
      *    Move  R1781910-Ut-Konsern-Nr  To    &...                     00330001
      *    Move  R1781910-Ut-Kunde-Nr    To    &...                     00340001
      *                                                                 00350001
      *                                                                 00360001
      * Insert:                                                         00370001
      * -------                                                         00380001
      *                                                                 00390001
      * Et normalt anrop kan f.eks. se slik ut:                         00400001
